(fn StepCameraPreviewAngle (Delta)
 (Variables|디폴트|SetCameraPreviewAngle (수학|플로트|Clamp(Float) (+ (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle) Delta) 15.0 35.0))
 (트랜스포메이션|SetWorldRotation :self (Variables|디폴트|GetViewCamera) :NewRotation (수학|로테이터|MakeRotator :Roll 0.0 :Pitch (- (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle)) :Yaw 90.0))
 (if (== (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle) 15.0) (개발|PrintString :InString "Camera: 15 deg | F6 -5 / F7 +5" :Duration 4.0 :Key "CameraPreview"))
 (if (== (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle) 20.0) (개발|PrintString :InString "Camera: 20 deg | F6 -5 / F7 +5" :Duration 4.0 :Key "CameraPreview"))
 (if (== (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle) 25.0) (개발|PrintString :InString "Camera: 25 deg | F6 -5 / F7 +5" :Duration 4.0 :Key "CameraPreview"))
 (if (== (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle) 30.0) (개발|PrintString :InString "Camera: 30 deg | F6 -5 / F7 +5" :Duration 4.0 :Key "CameraPreview"))
 (if (== (Variables|디폴트|GetCameraPreviewAngle) 35.0) (개발|PrintString :InString "Camera: 35 deg | F6 -5 / F7 +5" :Duration 4.0 :Key "CameraPreview"))
